  "name": "EXP-B \u2014 child darts from the gap between two parked vehicles (mechanism-preserving ranges v2)",
  "description": "Scene-model-first rendition. Two distinct parked groups (PARK_A upstream, PARK_B downstream) leave a narrow gap at the kerb. A child stands on the pavement behind that gap, fully hidden by PARK_A's downstream corner, and runs across when the ego is ~2 s from the gap. The reveal is late by construction; avoidance is by clearance timing, not by stopping.",
